<title>USA: Pasadena, Texas, schools yield 5.55 pct in 2011.</title>
<headline>Pasadena, Texas, schools yield 5.55 pct in 2011.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rauscher Pierce Refsnes Inc said Monday it tentatively priced $10.4 million Pasadena Independent School District, Texas, bonds at a top yield of 5.55 percent in 2011.</p>
<p>The preliminary pricing follows:</p>
